WEBVTT

00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,040
Finally, Dr. Connors, what's just one thing we should all ditch completely and replace with something

00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:09,440
healthier today? Oh boy, I mean, you could talk about diet and you could talk about all that

00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:15,440
kind of stuff. But I think, you know, with my journey in getting diagnosed with a cancer that has

00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:24,160
a seven percent five-year survival rate, made me think of what's really important. And I would say

00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:33,280
the thing that I'm working on ditching completely is judging, judging myself and judging others and

00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:40,240
putting expectations on others and putting expectations on myself that God hasn't placed.

00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:49,120
So that's just my journey that God's really working on me and ditching because I think that is

00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:54,640
at least for me, maybe it's just me, where I am judging myself again. But...

00:00:57,040 --> 00:01:01,360
Well, this reminds me of something I always say, you know, in fact, I included in my bio and my

00:01:01,360 --> 00:01:07,360
website sometimes that I believe that health is simple, wealth is doable, but happiness takes

00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:12,640
priority over both. Because, you know, if you get, I mean, health, it's simple, eat your veggies,

00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:17,920
eat your fruits, you know, take your supplements, your fitness exercise. I mean, it's not that complicated,

00:01:17,920 --> 00:01:23,280
but it's hard. And then, you know, wealth is doable, but it's not the most important thing in

00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:28,640
the world. And with everything, like, don't judge yourself, don't judge others, don't stress yourself

00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:35,760
out, you know, about eating the doughnut because your happiness should take priority over everything,

00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:37,760
I believe. That's right.

